@startuml
title VeilExchange: Connection State

skinparam BackgroundColor white
skinparam Shadowing false

[*] --> Started

Started --> Listening : listen(port)
Started --> Resolving : connect(address, port)

Listening --> TCPConnected : peer accepted
Resolving --> TCPConnecting : address resolved
TCPConnecting --> TCPConnected : TCP connection succeeds

TCPConnected --> TLSHandshake : client or server handshake
TLSHandshake --> Connected : handshake succeeds

Connected --> Connected : send or receive messages
Connected --> Connected : send or receive file data

Listening --> Error : accept fails
Resolving --> Error : resolution fails
TCPConnecting --> Error : connection fails
TLSHandshake --> Error : handshake fails
Connected --> Disconnected : peer closes connection
Connected --> Error : network operation fails

Error --> Disconnected : reportError()
Disconnected --> Stopped : stop()
Connected --> Stopped : /quit or stop()

Stopped --> [*]

@enduml
